DATA
----
This repository includes:

  * Deterministic seed files (constants, mappings, thresholds, labels) derived
    from official public open-data sources.

  * One FROZEN enrichment-output cache file, the output of a separate, closed
    classification process, included here as a fixed input. The process that
    generates it (prompts, models, compute) is not part of this repository.

      - seed_cache_geo_ap.csv
        Read by the dbt models: which location an investment line is assigned
        to reproduces end to end against it.

PERSONAL DATA
-------------
The grants (subventions) source data mixes organisations with private
individuals. Caches keyed by a beneficiary's name are therefore not published:

  * seed_cache_siret_by_name.csv linked a beneficiary name to a full legal
    name, SIRET, postcode and city. No model reads it.

  * seed_cache_thematique_beneficiaires.csv (Paris) and
    seed_marseille_cache_thematique.csv (Marseille) assigned a theme to each
    beneficiary name. Their staging models here keep the same columns with zero
    rows, so the build still runs and a grant's theme falls back to the rules
    downstream (pattern, then direction, then category, then "Non classifié").
    Theme splits built from this repository therefore differ from the site's;
    amounts and counts do not.

Underlying source data belongs to its respective publishers (e.g. Ville de
Paris / Paris Open Data, data.economie.gouv.fr / DECP, DGFiP, and the
equivalent portals for other covered cities) and remains subject to their own
terms and licenses. Dataset references are declared in the dbt sources and in
each ingestion script.

NOT INCLUDED
------------
The website/application, the enrichment code (LLM descriptions, summaries,
thematic/geo/archive grounding), and media assets are maintained separately and
are not part of this repository.

Editorial and enrichment *content* is likewise not included: curated place
selections, generated glosses and plain-English descriptions, verified archive
excerpts, and lieux curation. No dbt model reads these, so no figure published
on the site depends on them.
